Cell["\<\
The shell sizes on the 12 \[Times] 12 square torus. They grow by 4 up to \
radius 5, as in the plane; at radius 6 the shell meets itself, and it shrinks \
to the single antipode at radius 12:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"c74a7e48-0a79-447f-b58d-a8329f0975b0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

